--- !u!114 &5549417038117067005
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3717943526520243921}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 993d8d8b34a954049b05eb7b4bbba012, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Npc
  npcName: Granny Purl
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8df4a05a124954ba99977177d5853464, type: 3}
  voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a15a46db7ca314ba796a835e1efee8d9, type: 3}
  giftSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a142d3c7adcfa46989d2fae3161d654d, type: 3}
  conversations:
  - requires: 
    notIf: met:Granny Purl
    sets: met:Granny Purl
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Well, hello, dear! Granny Purl. I knit, you know. Scarves, hats, mittens, the odd tea cosy.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Mr. Frost over there is wanting a scarf, poor lamb. But I haven't a scrap of wool left. The Snow Yeti flung my whole basket off the mountain.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: If you find me a ball of yarn, dear, I'll knit him the loveliest scarf you've ever seen. Barnaby Badger sells wool in Hollyhock, down at the castle.
  - requires: has:ball_of_yarn
    notIf: purl:knit
    sets: purl:knit
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: warm_scarf
    takeItem: ball_of_yarn
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: A ball of red wool! Oh, you dear thing. Give it here.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Click-clack, click-clack... knit one, purl one... and a long loop for luck... and...
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: There! A warm scarf, red and cream. Take it to Mr. Frost, quick, before he rattles to bits!
  - requires: cleared:Frost4
    notIf: purl:cheered
    sets: purl:cheered
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: It's gone ever so quiet up the mountain. You've beaten the Yeti! He's not wicked, you know. Just hungry for company.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: If you've time, dear, I could knit you a hat. But you've a Snow Hat already, I expect. Good for you.
  - requires: met:Mr. Frost
    notIf: purl:knit
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: A ball of yarn, dear. Barnaby Badger's stall, down in Hollyhock by the castle. Then I'll knit away.
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Knit one, purl one. That's how I got my name, you know. Granny Purl. It was Granny Plain before. Dull.
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: The secret of good knitting is patience. And a cat to chase the wool. I've no cat. Pity.
  talkOffset: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  flipbook: {fileID: 8056376660749562460}
  idleFrames:
  - {fileID: 1555722676, guid: 4772554270b984b35b163ba974557cf0, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 37515945, guid: 4772554270b984b35b163ba974557cf0, type: 3}
  talkFrames:
  - {fileID: -1747735908, guid: 4772554270b984b35b163ba974557cf0, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -1676084822, guid: 4772554270b984b35b163ba974557cf0, type: 3}
  idleFps: 2
  talkFps: 6
